[h1]Random Whisker[/h1]
[b]Spawn a random Whisker at the dock with one click.[/b]

[list]
[*]A cat-head button sits at the left edge of the HUD, below Remote Campfire's icon.
[*]Each click brings one new Whisker to your dock.
[*]The game rolls name, look and traits. New Whiskers arrive without education.
[*]The button hides in menus, open windows and while saving.
[*]Tooltip in English and German; other languages use English.
[/list]

[h2]Getting started[/h2]
Subscribe, let Steam download the mod, then restart the game. Click the cat-head button during play. Use either a Workshop copy or a local installation, never both.

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
[b]Windows, Whiskerwood 0.7.209.0[/b] (game build of 16 October 2026).

The mod calls the game's own spawn action and ships as ordinary Blueprints. No runtime DLL is required.

[url=https://github.com/repte/whiskerwood-random-whisker]Source, implementation and feedback on GitHub[/url]

[h2]Credits[/h2]
Unofficial community mod built with the [url=https://github.com/Whiskerwood-Modding/Whiskerwood-Project]Whiskerwood modkit[/url] by Buckminsterfullerene and Whiskerwood-Modding. Game assets belong to their respective owners.

